 behind him because nevadans  know he has the leadership and  experience that they can trust to get  our state back on track after syslax  failed policies in fact in his closing  remarks sheriff lombardo turning his  attacks on governor sisilak let's be  honest with each other for all practical  purposes this primary is over  there's nothing more to argue about i've  weathered 12 months of attacks from  steve syslag in his packs and for most  of the individuals standing here next to  me  and why why why have i been able to work  weather them they're all bogus they're  not working  governor steve sisilak campaigned  responding to the debate tonight on  channel 8 saying in part no republican  candidate running for governor has the  experience plan or temperament needed to  move nevada forward he added that each  is making promises that would move our  state backwards now you can watch the  full debate the hour-long debate find  everything you need to know about the  upcoming primary posted to eight newsnow  dot com

